          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i kaahi, «Aníng gár ni oo' i deer dír inslaawoó múk Israeli, kudá' yaamaá naa muk'eé' haniís nga hhitine'. Ga/aaweek, Mukwí tlákw aníng un hingeés baraá yaamuuine. Tam múk Yuda un hingeés baraá yaamuuine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaá ngiwa hingemiís in malé gurtláw, umuú xoorooro an ki/ís dirós nee baraá yaamuuwós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaá kaangwí bira waaraáhh, inooín barnaxes alhotaarír muk'eé' kaa intsatsaáhh ar muunuú ló', nee bar lo'o ngaa umuueér /ayiyé' tawa kaahi, ‹Ar adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ir hotaatina.› Adoodá' aáng muk'eé' ngura intsaahhatisiyé' lo'o ngiwa /ayiya' ar mungú Ba'ali, daqaní inooín tari hoot baraá tla/ángw muk'eene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala umuúqo xoorór aníng i iiárií qamimaaká, aníng an hingeés nee ngari hhaamiís. Anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ tí ngina oó'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
